	// ListEvents List events
	//
	// Lists the stored CloudEvents envelopes of the active organisation, the same bodies webhook endpoints receive (data schemas: `/schemas/events/{type}/v{N}.json`). Events are kept for the event retention period. Filters: `type` (repeatable or comma list; `message.*` matches a whole family), `accountId`, and the time range `from` / `to` (inclusive, RFC 3339). An account-bound API key sees only its account's events. Pagination: `limit` (default 50, max 200) with `cursor` from `nextCursor`, or `page` with `includeTotal`; sort `time` or `id` (prefix `-` for descending, default `-time`). Requires the `read` permission (API keys `events:read`). Read-only.
