	//
	// Server-sent events with every new record that matches the filter, from all nodes, at most 50 records per second per subscriber (slow clients drop records). Each event has `id: <log ID>` and `data: <LogRecord JSON>`; a `:keepalive` comment is sent every 15 seconds. The stream starts with a `: tail started` comment and has no history — use `GET /v1/logs` for the past. Requires `logs.read` (owners, admins, operators; API keys `logs:read`) and sees only the active organisation's records; instance owners (signed in) see every organisation and instance-level records.
