	// ListQueueItems List the records waiting in a queue
	//
	// Lists the domain records behind a work queue — outbound messages (`EMAILBRIDGE_SUBMIT`), webhook deliveries (`EMAILBRIDGE_DELIVERY`) or system mail (`EMAILBRIDGE_SYSMAIL`) — that are scheduled, waiting, retry-waiting, dead-lettered or in flight, oldest first. Each item says whether it can be cancelled (`cancellable`; an item a worker is transmitting is `inFlight`). Sending needs `read` (API keys `outbound:read`), webhook deliveries `read` (`deliveries:read`); account-bound and resource-limited API keys see only their accounts / endpoints, and system mail sent through an account is not listed. System mail and `scope=all` (every organisation) are for the instance owner only. `EMAILBRIDGE_EVENTS` has no item list (`404`). Pagination: `page` (1-based) and `limit` (default 25, max 100), `total` capped at 10 000; sort by `createdAt` or `nextAttemptAt` (prefix `-` for descending). Read-only.
