// GetAutoconfig Discover IMAP/SMTP settings
//
// Looks up the IMAP and SMTP settings for an email address so a setup form can prefill them: the built-in provider list first, then Mozilla ISPDB, Autodiscover, RFC 6186 SRV records and finally a guess from the MX host (`source` says which answered; `none` with no servers when nothing was found). `oauthHint` tells when the provider prefers OAuth (Gmail, Microsoft 365), `pec` / `pecDefaults` when the domain is a known PEC provider. Results are cached; nothing is stored and no login is tried (use `POST /v1/accounts/verify` for that). Outbound lookups go through the egress policy. Limited to 30 lookups per minute per organisation. Requires the `read` permission (API keys `accounts:read`).
