// GetPECReceiptRaw Download the signed raw PEC receipt
//
// Streams the receipt exactly as the PEC provider signed it (RFC 822, `message/rfc822`, `<receiptId>.eml`): from the evidence archive when the receipt was archived, otherwise from the message archive or IMAP. The `Digest` header carries the SHA-256 stored at arrival, so the file can be checked against `sha256`. Needs `pec.enabled` on the receipt's account. Requires the `read` permission (API keys `messages:read` or `messages:read:<accountId>`). Read-only.
