// PatchTemplateWithBody Update template
//
// Changes a template (JSON Merge Patch: omitted fields stay). A change to any content field (subject, text, html, htmlFormat, partials, strict, locale, timezone) stores the previous content as an immutable version and increments `currentVersion`; renaming alone does not. Queued messages rendered from an older version are not touched. A change to `html` or `htmlFormat` recompiles an MJML part (switching to `html` drops `htmlCompiled`); invalid MJML is `422 validation_failed` with `errors[]` at `body.html`. Send the last `ETag` as `If-Match` (`412 version_mismatch`). Requires `outbound.write` (owner, admin, operator; API keys `outbound:write`) and the `sending.templates` switch (`403 feature_disabled` when off).
