	// Unsubscribes the recipient in the token: the address is added to the organisation's `unsubscribe` suppression list (scoped to the message's mailing list when it had a `List-Id`), `list.unsubscribed` is emitted and a short HTML confirmation is returned. This is the target of `List-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click` (mail providers POST it directly) and of the confirmation page's button. Repeating it is harmless. Public: the signed token is the credential.
