	//
	// Changes an account; omitted fields stay unchanged and `externalId: null` removes the external ID. `metadata` is a JSON Merge Patch of the stored metadata: listed keys are set, a key set to `null` is removed, `metadata: null` removes every key; the merged object must stay within the limits of `POST /v1/accounts`. `imap` / `smtp` are sent as whole objects, but empty values keep what is stored (send `auth.pass` only to replace the password). Changing servers, credentials or protocol-log switches queues a reconnect (`configChanged`); a credential change that reaches a different mailbox than the pinned identity fails with `409 identity_mismatch` (re-pin with `POST …/identity/repin`). `disabled: true` stops the account (re-enable with `POST …/resume`); `oauth.appId` binds an app-only OAuth app. Requires `accounts.write` (API keys `accounts:write`). Send the last `ETag` as `If-Match` to avoid lost updates (`412 version_mismatch`). Emits `account.updated` (and `account.stateChanged` when the state moves); writes an `account.update` audit record.
