	//
	// Lists the PEC receipts (ricevute) the account received: acceptance, delivery, error and virus receipts parsed from daticert.xml, with the S/MIME signature check and, when `pec.evidenceArchive` was on, the evidence archive reference. Receipts about a message EmailBridge sent carry its `outboundId`; filter with `outboundId` to see one message's trail, with `type`, or with `q` (prefix of the transport ID or of `deliveredTo`). Needs the `pec.enabled` switch on the account (`403 feature_disabled`). Requires the `read` permission (API keys `messages:read` or `messages:read:<accountId>`). Pagination: `limit` (default 50, max 200) with `cursor`, or `page` with `includeTotal`; sort `at` or `type` (default `-at`). Read-only.
