	// Returns the IMAP and SMTP transcript of an account, oldest line first: every command EmailBridge sent (`dir: C`) and every server answer (`dir: S`), with passwords, OAuth tokens and AUTH payloads masked. Lines are only recorded while the account's `protocolLogs.enabled` switch is on, and they expire with the log retention. Filters: the time range `from` / `to` (both or neither; default the last 7 days, at most 31 days), `proto` and `connId`. Cursor paging with `limit` (default 50, max 200). Lines live on the node that held the connection: `partial` lists nodes that did not answer in time. Requires the `read` permission (API keys `accounts:read` or `accounts:read:<accountId>`). Read-only.
